K {"id": "Q02", "expected_answer": "Four players start at 1 VP; three at 0. Each has two Agents on Leader and third beside board, three troops in garrison with remaining nine in supply, and one water.", "source_references": "Main pp4–5 / extraction 254–303", "novelty": "Player setup"}
S {"id": "Q02", "corrected_authoritative_source_references": [{"source": "M", "file": "/home/jonny/projects/boardgame-rules/docs/quality/summary-qa/dune-imperium-uprising/2026-11-04-batch-231507/dune-imperium-uprising-rules.txt", "kind": "text_lines", "lines": [289, 294], "pdf_pages": [5], "sha256": "b3ce948cce744b9b6ec8c4de16dbe76d8b393da9a5c7aa77d0d74d3f12aa229b"}, {"source": "M", "file": "/home/jonny/projects/boardgame-rules/docs/quality/summary-qa/dune-imperium-uprising/2026-11-04-batch-231507/dune-imperium-uprising-rules.txt", "kind": "text_lines", "lines": [301, 319], "pdf_pages": [5], "sha256": "b3ce948cce744b9b6ec8c4de16dbe76d8b393da9a5c7aa77d0d74d3f12aa229b"}]}
A {"id": "Q02", "answer": "A human starts at 1 VP in a four-player game and 0 VP in a three-player game. Both setups give 2 Agents on the Leader and the Swordmaster beside the board, 12 troops total with 3 in the garrison and 9 in supply, and 1 water.", "support": "supported", "evidence": "Setup step 6: Score marker on 1 in a 4-player game, otherwise 0; two Agents; 3 troops in garrison, 9 in supply; take 1 water."}
