K {"id": "Q03", "expected_answer": "May Reveal early; no more turns this phase after Reveal. Only cards remaining in hand and just revealed supply Reveal effects, not Agent-turn cards. Clean Up puts all Agent and Reveal cards in discard pile.", "source_references": "Main pp8,12 / extraction 360–379,637–673", "novelty": "Reveal commitment and destinations"}
S {"id": "Q03", "corrected_authoritative_source_references": [{"source": "M", "file": "/home/jonny/projects/boardgame-rules/docs/quality/summary-qa/dune-imperium-uprising/2026-11-04-batch-231507/dune-imperium-uprising-rules.txt", "kind": "text_lines", "lines": [407, 417], "pdf_pages": [8], "sha256": "b3ce948cce744b9b6ec8c4de16dbe76d8b393da9a5c7aa77d0d74d3f12aa229b"}, {"source": "M", "file": "/home/jonny/projects/boardgame-rules/docs/quality/summary-qa/dune-imperium-uprising/2026-11-04-batch-231507/dune-imperium-uprising-rules.txt", "kind": "text_lines", "lines": [715, 746], "pdf_pages": [12], "sha256": "b3ce948cce744b9b6ec8c4de16dbe76d8b393da9a5c7aa77d0d74d3f12aa229b"}]}
A {"id": "Q03", "answer": "Yes, you may take a Reveal turn while you still have Agents, and after Revealing you are skipped for the rest of Player Turns, so cannot take another Agent turn that round. Reveal effects come only from cards revealed in the Reveal step, not Agent-turn cards. At Clean Up, move all cards in front of you from both kinds of turns to your discard pile.", "support": "supported", "evidence": "Player Turns; Reveal Turn: resolve Reveal boxes of just-revealed cards; Clean Up moves all cards in front of you to discard."}
B {"id": "Q03", "answer": "Yes, you may Reveal while Agents remain, but once you Reveal you are skipped for the rest of Player Turns and cannot take a later Agent turn that round. Reveal effects come only from cards remaining in hand and revealed then; Agent-turn cards use their Agent boxes, not Reveal boxes. At Clean Up, all cards in front of you from Agent and Reveal turns go to your discard pile.", "support": "supported", "evidence": "Turn Structure: Agent turns optional; after Reveal turns skipped; Reveal Cards / Resolve Reveal Effects / Clean Up."}
