S {"id": "Q06", "corrected_authoritative_source_references": [{"source": "M", "file": "/home/jonny/projects/boardgame-rules/docs/quality/summary-qa/dune-imperium-uprising/2026-11-04-batch-231507/dune-imperium-uprising-rules.txt", "kind": "text_lines", "lines": [657, 676], "pdf_pages": [11], "sha256": "b3ce948cce744b9b6ec8c4de16dbe76d8b393da9a5c7aa77d0d74d3f12aa229b"}]}
A {"id": "Q06", "answer": "A Spy Agent icon lets an Agent go to any space connected to one of your Spy-occupied observation posts without recalling that Spy. Infiltrate recalls your Spy at a connected post to bypass another player's Agent on the destination; it cannot bypass your own Agent. Gather Intelligence recalls a connected Spy after Agent placement and before any space or card effects to draw a card. The same Spy cannot pay for both; you may use two different Spies for Infiltrate and Gather Intelligence. Choose Gather Intelligence immediately after placing the Agent.", "support": "supported", "evidence": "Spies & observation posts: Spy Agent icon; Infiltrate; Gather Intelligence timing; cannot recall same Spy for both."}
