A {"id": "Q17", "answer": "With CHOAM and contracts available, the icon takes one of the two face-up contracts and replaces it with a face-up token from the bank; without CHOAM, or once all contracts have been taken, it gives 2 Solari. A Harvest contract completes by visiting a Maker space and gaining the stated spice total that turn; Immediate completes as soon as taken; Acquire The Spice Must Flow completes when you next acquire that card.", "support": "supported", "evidence": "Taking contracts; Completing contracts; Human contract icon shared rule."}
